# only read when the build context is the project root — an all-typescript
# project's apps/*/Dockerfile.workspace (see docs/PROVENANCE.md). node_modules
# is copied from a pinned build stage; a host copy landing after it would
# overwrite the pinned one with whatever the developer has locally.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage

# never belongs in an image
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
